  "purpose": "Fallback sensor parameters for light frames whose FITS headers lack BAYERPAT (ADR-084). Header cards always win; file-name tokens come next; this catalogue is the last resort. Every value taken from here is shown to the owner and must be confirmed or corrected before processing.",
  "pattern_convention": "Bayer pattern as the vendor's own capture software writes BAYERPAT for a full-sensor (no ROI, bin 1) frame, applied to the FITS pixel array in stored order (first stored pixel = pattern origin). ROI offsets, odd crops, flips or another capture program can shift the pattern, so a catalogue pattern is never applied without confirmation.",
  "confidence_levels": {
    "verified_local": "BAYERPAT/layout confirmed by FITS headers of the owner's own frames from this camera model",
    "vendor": "manufacturer documentation or product page",
    "retailer": "retailer specification sheet",
    "community": "user reports (forums); may conflict between units or programs",
    "typical": "inferred from the sensor family and the vendor's usual readout; lowest confidence"
  },
